            {
              "id": "0d2bd611-c255-3e14-aa92-70408e01d982",
              "name": "Open Redirect Vulnerability in Data Request Handling",
              "helpUri": "https://www.glog.ai/",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Description\n\nOpen Redirect Vulnerability in Data Request Handling is a security flaw that can occur in web applications, where an attacker can redirect a user to a malicious website by manipulating the parameters of the redirect URL. In Python, this vulnerability can occur when the application uses user-supplied input to construct a redirect URL without proper validation.\n\nIn the provided code snippet, the application is redirecting the user to the URL provided in the 'redirect' parameter of the GET request. If an attacker can control the value of this parameter, they can redirect the user to any URL of their choice, potentially leading to phishing attacks, session theft, or forcing the user to perform unwanted actions.\n\n## Mitigation Advice\n\nTo mitigate this vulnerability, the application should not allow user-supplied input to dictate the destination of a redirect without validation. The application should maintain a whitelist of valid URLs to redirect to, and any user-supplied input should be checked against this whitelist before the redirect occurs.\n\n## Source Code Fix Recommendation\n\n```python\nfrom django.http import HttpResponseRedirect\nfrom django.urls import reverse\n\ndef view(request):\n    redirect_url = request.GET.get('redirect', '/taskManager/')\n    if redirect_url not in ['valid_url1', 'valid_url2', '/taskManager/']:\n        redirect_url = reverse('default_view')\n    return HttpResponseRedirect(redirect_url)\n```\n\nIn this fixed code, the application maintains a list of valid URLs to redirect to. If the user-supplied URL is not in this list, the application redirects to a default view.\n\n## Library Dependencies\n\n- Django\n\n## References\n\n- [OWASP Unvalidated Redirects and Forwards Cheat Sheet](https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Unvalidated_Redirects_and_Forwards_Cheat_Sheet.html)\n- [CWE-601: URL Redirection to Untrusted Site ('Open Redirect')](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/601.html)"
              },
